                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Full disclosure: My \"friend\" bought me this game.\n\nThe game just starts when you start it up, like starting a movie.\n\nGhost Train VR lasts about... 5 minutes? Maybe 8 minutes? Just watch the preview video 8 times and imagine there are some other monsters that appear and some other overly-loud noises that go with their appearance and boom, you have just imagined Ghost Train VR. There is zero interactivity, by the way.\n\nOh and the game ends when you get to the end of the tracks and just sit there as long as you want.\n\nFull disclosure: I have one less \"friend\" now.",
